    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Data-psalm Conclave",
    "summary": "As the first battle round opens, choose a benediction for your CULT MECHANICUS units. It stays active through battle end. PANEGYRIC PROCESSION improves AP by 1 for each CULT MECHANICUS model’s ranged attack against a target at half range or closer. CITATION IN SAVAGERY checks a CULT MECHANICUS unit when you pick it to fight. If it completed a Charge Move that turn, give its models’ melee attacks +1 Attacks and +1 Strength through phase end.",
